#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_searching.rst:29
#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_searching.rst:40
msgid "Searching the Project Bin"
msgstr "Поиск в корзине проекта"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_searching.rst:31
msgid "You can search by name for any asset in the Project Bin."
msgstr "В корзине проекта можно искать любой ресурс по имени."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_searching.rst:42
msgid ""
"Enter the search term into the :guilabel:`Search` field. Kdenlive will start "
"filtering the asset list immediately and continue adjusting the search "
"results as you type."
msgstr ""
"Введите условие поиска в поле :guilabel:`Поиск`. Kdenlive сразу начнёт "
"фильтровать список ресурсов и будет уточнять результаты по мере ввода."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_searching.rst:44
msgid ""
"Searching takes the entire filename including any suffixes (e.g. :file:`."
"ac3`) into account."
msgstr ""
"Поиск учитывает полное имя файла, включая расширения (например, :file:`."
"ac3`)."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_searching.rst:49
msgid ""
"Searching takes place only in the current view. If you want to search in "
"folders you must open the folder first."
msgstr ""
"Поиск выполняется только в текущем представлении. Чтобы искать в папках, "
"сначала откройте папку."
